config IOTDRV_TUYA_THERMOSTAT
	bool "Tuya thermostat models"
	depends on IOTDRV_TUYA_MCU
	help
	  The datapoint maps of the 13 floor-heating thermostats of
	  tuya_thermostat_zrd and the conversions between their datapoints and
	  the values of the Zigbee Thermostat cluster, schedules included.
